  "description": "EVO PDF Security Library for .NET can be used in .NET Framework, .NET Core and .NET Standard applications to manage the security settings of PDF documents.\n\nThis package is compatible with .NET Framework, .NET Core and .NET Standard 2.0 on Windows platforms.\n\nThe compatibility list includes the following .NET versions, platforms and application types:\n\n* .NET Framework 4.0 and above\n* .NET 6, 7, 8, 9 and 10\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* Windows platforms\n* Azure App Service\n* Azure Cloud Services and Azure Virtual Machines\n* Web, Console and Desktop applications\n\nMain Features:\n\n* Secure PDF documents from files and streams\n* Save secured documents in memory or to files\n* Set user and owner passwords\n* Encrypt PDF document content\n* Support AES and RC4 encryption algorithms\n* Support 40, 128 and 256-bit encryption keys\n* Set PDF document permissions (print, edit, copy)\n* Remove PDF document security settings using a user or owner password\n\nDocumentation and code samples:\nhttps://www.evopdf.com/evopdf-pdf-security-dotnet",
